;    0: TWdLink(count=5854, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\すずめ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Dazzling light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A shut window.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Birdsong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My body wouldn't move properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All the feeling in my body was dull.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...? <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> is here...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? Why did I think something like 'alive'?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have I ever had reason to question whether I was alive or dead...?<PG>
............! That's right!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was strangled by <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"G-Goto...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! You can't move! Your neck is hurt!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> pinned me down by both shoulders.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> body bumped the IV stand, and it swayed with a rattle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> started crying, tears streaming down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... what happened...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"What happened, you ask...! I'd like to know that myself...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What's happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What happened last night!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
The sparrows' chirping faded behind <STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> tearful voice.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you don't really know either, do you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... wake up...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"I see... I'm glad..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"There's nothing to be glad about! I can't bear to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> like that...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Explain it to me properly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't tell you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because I can't...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">No, this won't do. I have to tell you properly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, no matter what state you see </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in, can you accept it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm ready. If last night wasn't a dream, then probably―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right. Then I'll put you in the wheelchair."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Maybe because of my neck injury, I couldn't move my body well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... is my body going to stay like this, not moving, forever too...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, they say it's temporary. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Once your stomach is better, you can be discharged, they say."</STYLE><PG>
Apparently my body will be back to normal soon, but what about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Isn't she heading in an even worse direction than before?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Won't I end up not even being able to see <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?<PG>
If I hadn't been in a wheelchair, I'd probably have stopped walking out of anxiety.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I kept that anxiety to myself and, at the same pace as <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, headed to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reality I truly have to face head-on―starts now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We changed floors in the elevator and stepped into a separate wing I'd never been to before.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\神経科病棟.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This was... the neurology ward.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
The air was a little different from the surgical ward I'd been in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... it wasn't the air that was different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was an unmistakable strange sound.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
The wheelchair was heading toward that strange sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the source of the strange sound was where we were going.<PG>
As we went on, the strange sound grew clearer―
{PAUSE ""}
and I realized what it really was: a human scream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a voice I'd heard almost every day until 2 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I felt no nostalgia.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A crazed, horrible voice was carrying all the way here.<PG>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> stopped right there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, it's nothing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
The wheelchair was trembling slightly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> arms and legs that were shaking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wait, just a moment..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her voice seemed to be shaking too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, aren't you scared...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered immediately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I won't turn away from reality anymore.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> nerves of steel... I'll learn from them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> started pushing the wheelchair again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I could hear screaming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voice was unmistakably <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it was a voice worn out from too much screaming, somehow strengthless, like air leaking out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> stopped the wheelchair in front of a certain room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\面会謝絶.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A room with a 'No Visitors' sign.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A room with no nameplate.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Diiiie!"</STYLE><PG>
<TXSPN>Like a broken record, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> kept screaming the same thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Last night came back to me clearly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had been screaming the same kind of thing at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then she strangled me with all her strength―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wheelchair shook harder than before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if you're scared, I'll go in alone. There's probably staff or someone inside, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> trembling made the wheelchair rattle faintly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I'm going too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> knocked on the door, riding her momentum.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
But no one came out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Couldn't they hear it over <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> voice?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, let's just go in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> put her hand on the door, but just stood there trembling, unable to move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was impatient, but I couldn't rush her either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, a man in a white coat came along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He seemed to be a doctor.<PG>
"I'm sorry, no visitors are allowed right now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, my name is Kogori. I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, you're <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Um... well..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Please let me in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cut him off, his tone sounding like a refusal to let me in.<PG>
At that, the doctor let out a light sigh, then silently put his hand on the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> took her hand off the door and covered her ears with both hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I moved my numb hand and grabbed <STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> skirt.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, wait over there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Doctor, I'm sorry, could you push me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, ears still covered, left without a word.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Once I'd made sure <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was out of sight, I had the doctor push my wheelchair, and went into the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside, there was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\春花拘束.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花処置室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Two doctors and three nurses, surrounding a single bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "堕ちる.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花発狂.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Surrounded by strange machines, writhing and screaming on a bed with only a mattress, was <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her body was bound in a straitjacket and straps.<PG>
"Um, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san</STYLE> has been like this the whole time..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She keeps cycling between frenzy and blackout, once an hour. Ever since last night."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花発狂横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
{STOPSND "SE" "300" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n585\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n585\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"N-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...! It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　<TXSPS>Ha ha ha, hurry up and die! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Diiiiie!! I'll kiiiiill you!!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, slick with sweat and snot and saliva, lunged forward like a madwoman, her face blank.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="やまんば">mountain hag</STYLE>, she thrashed her hair about and writhed as if she would bite into me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
