{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
2 years ago, I got on a train with <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> to escape the shinigami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That time too, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> declared my death to me with a terrifying look.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But back then, her feelings for me and her desperation seeped through.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花発狂.lcm" "REPEAT" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花処置室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, as she was now, was like a robot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was frightening, but her voice, her expression, the way she writhed, were all as lifeless as a programmed machine.<PG>
