{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Then, suddenly, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> went quiet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a rioter suddenly shot in the head, she didn't so much as twitch.<PG>
Immediately, the doctors and nurses set about examining <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> body and cleaning up the saliva and snot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> took a big breath every few seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Breathing that didn't seem to be her own doing, like <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="かがく">mandibular</STYLE> breathing (the <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="きょうかく">chest</STYLE> breathing that occurs just before death), ghah, ghah.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"How did this happen..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We have run every kind of test, but the cause is just... 
{PAUSE ""}
What we do know is that <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san's</STYLE> brain waves have remained in a <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="こんすい">comatose</STYLE> state the entire time. 
{PAUSE ""}
All of this behavior is happening not by <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san's</STYLE> will, but by reflex."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"By reflex...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yes. <STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> is still asleep. 
{PAUSE ""}
And yet, a reflex where the body moves on its own and even produces a voice. 
{PAUSE ""}
Something like this, I have never seen, never even heard of..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then it doesn't mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wants me to die, does it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well... one could put it that way, but..."<PG>
That was a single ray of light shining into this hopeless scene.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> wasn't acting like this because she wanted to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something had just gone wrong.<PG>
"Also... for some reason, one of <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san's</STYLE> eyes has turned green..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Green...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes. For something like this to happen suddenly is unthinkable. 
{PAUSE ""}
I apologize, but almost everything is a mystery to us. 
{PAUSE ""}
Except for one thing."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"One thing...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"This is not the best time to say it, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>, I understand you have been living a very busy life all this time. 
{PAUSE ""}
Most likely, you had <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="た">built</STYLE> up a considerable amount of stress."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I suppose so. That's why it came out in my body too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Even so... um... 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
I would say that sort of thing is not good."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Excuse me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花処置室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"We ran blood tests on <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san</STYLE>, and it showed up clearly. 
{PAUSE ""}
We will not be reporting this to the police ourselves, so as for treatment for that, too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Now I understand even less."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"An alkaloid-type drug was detected in <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san's</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san's</STYLE> blood. 
{PAUSE ""}
Surely you have some idea about this?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Alkaloid...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's what stimulants and drugs are made of."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Stim... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Huh!? W-wait a second! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I don't use anything like that! Let alone on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE><PG>
"Listen, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
I do not know what you used, but this is a crime. 
{PAUSE ""}
Using it on <STYLE ID="2">a comatose patient</STYLE> as well is out of the question. <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san's</STYLE> symptoms may also be coming from that. 
{PAUSE ""}
Treating your ulcer and your neck is important, but I strongly recommend treatment for that as well."<PG>
I don't use anything like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tired as I was, the idea of using something like that had never even occurred to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if in resonance with <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, my voice wouldn't come out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Unable to say anything, I was taken out of the room and pushed to the waiting room where <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院廊下椅子.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
