These are the blood test results for <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san</STYLE>. I think you, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>, will understand them."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Doctor, what do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the doctor handed <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> the results and walked off without saying anything.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you knew that doctor?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. I told you before that I wrote a paper on unapproved drugs, didn't I? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Back then, I interviewed doctors at this hospital too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Having said that much, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> silently began looking over our test results.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. This is interesting."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Interesting?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand what the doctor meant. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Just to be sure, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're not using any dangerous drugs, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course not..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's all I needed to hear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We just might be able to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Before that, you'll need a full explanation too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, please!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It says here, 'Alkaloid-type（similar to ephedrine）detected.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you only look at the numbers, it's understandable that people would mistakenly think you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, were using stimulants."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm not using anything like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course I know that. There are two points at issue. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">First, that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> showed the same drug reaction too, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and second, the wording '</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="・・">similar</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to ephedrine.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">First, about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. The day before yesterday, I took over for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and looked after </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Remember?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That was before I went to my part-time job, right? You said I looked tired, so I should rest properly before work."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"On that day, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, after you went home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had her blood drawn for a routine checkup. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The results from then are here too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As of the blood draw the day before yesterday, nothing abnormal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In last night's blood draw, this ephedrine-like substance was detected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do you see what this means?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, it means a drug was used on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sometime between the blood draw the day before yesterday and last night, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. And the same thing was detected in you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's suppose that, for some reason, that substance was already in your body from before."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? What kind of nasty assumption is that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll explain why I'm assuming this later. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Under that assumption, between the day before yesterday and last night, there must have been stronger biological contact than usual between you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The only thing I can think of is when you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, vomited blood―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">in other words, when there was contact at the blood level, something happened in </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You mean the blood I vomited made </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> like that?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\吐血2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. But it's impossible for an alkaloid to be passed on just from that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then the blood-contact theory doesn't work?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No. What concerns me there is the substance '</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="・・">similar</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">' to ephedrine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Inside the two of you, there's something that looks like ephedrine but isn't. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To be precise, it has been in your body from the start, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But nothing like that has ever shown up in school blood tests..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course not. School-level health checks don't test that thoroughly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> frenzy is what made the doctor suspect stimulants. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, inside your body, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, there's something '</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="・・">similar</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">' to ephedrine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And a substance that spreads to the other person through mere contact with blood."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Something like that being in my body all along... that feels like a stretch, even as an assumption... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Is there even such a substance? Something like 'contagious drugs'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Frankly, I've never heard of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe when </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died―when you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, were bathed in </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">his</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood, the same kind of thing happened as now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that was also around when you became afraid of cherry blossoms and awakened to precognition, and given the unusual constitution only you have, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, blood contact stands out as the cause."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't really get it, but you mean that ephedrine-like thing is causing my danger sense and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> symptoms?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's a forced assumption, but that's what I mean. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, I'd guess that by removing the ephedrine-like substance from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body, we can suppress that frenzy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, if she's reflexively hostile toward you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="・・">only</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> you, then the cause must be something connected to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do you know how to remove it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院廊下椅子.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... what I'll think about next."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With everything unknown, all I can do is rely on <STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> reasoning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But however brilliant <STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> mind is, she's still a high school student.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll go talk to the doctor from earlier and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... that's the detective who looked after us 2 years ago, right? You're still in touch?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">That man</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a lolicon, after all. If I ask him even a little, he'll help with just about anything."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So what the regulars at my part-time job were saying was true.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, lolicon or silicon, if he'll help us, that's reassuring.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But will the doctor here be okay...? Even though he suspects me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If he suspected you, he'd have called the police already. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than suspecting you, the doctor himself is baffled by this unknown phenomenon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why he handed this to me and asked for help."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had built powerful connections and trust without my knowing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Once I get you back to your room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'll try contacting everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I find out anything... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, even if I don't find out anything, I'll come back and report. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, for now, just think about your own body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your endoscopic treatment for your stomach is starting soon, too."</STYLE>
